{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fb458b5aa2712a4b4bc078f5eeb68f1bd32e6fcba4fee1bd7c87b3913f6d3125","ja":"おばけを退治する方法","zh":"消灭妖怪的方法","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6794247524ce9892affeb023961b14309aacaff1b16e23a45820dbf729220acc","ja":"あ、あの！\nこれもスタッフさんから聞いたんですけど……。","zh":"那个，请问！\n这个也是听工作人员说的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8fa0e181eeed2ce49d2f5fc9f955b901f1119e0c0c5985093b55e199fa45b0c0","ja":"準備で人がたくさん出入りしてる時とか、\nライトアップしている時には、何も起こらなかったって！","zh":"筹备期间人来人往的时候，\n或者点亮彩灯的时候，都什么也没发生过！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2fb64781be3ee8a32f32636578fb60202518bcb2595472a84509e6c32309da0e","ja":"で、でしたら、今宵も……。","zh":"那、那么，今夜也……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b6c892b2c08d705af8f147ae8bf133378f442544ba751429fe492a7ca325c956","ja":"はい。今日は、お客さんもたくさんいますし、\nライトだってありますから！","zh":"是的。今天观众不仅来了很多，\n还有灯光呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a65a98b613555c670210e3de53aaad7d661693b95de45c6becea4d44933462d5","ja":"にぎやかな集いが、この世ならざる者たちを\n遠ざけてくれる可能性が高い、と……？","zh":"热闹的聚会很有可能会让非尘世之物\n远离我们，是这样吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1c19cb2e4573645253c361957e956265b5128eea93c1b27f9e02e4216b4c1cdc","ja":"そ、そうです！　だから私たちも、\n頑張って盛り上げたら、きっと……！","zh":"没、没错！所以只要我们也\n努力把气氛炒热的话，一定……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7bdbe016b79e9c615b9373ed11e5bedf08b1ca4253ee77e7362e9a29522a0e63","ja":"なるほど。私達はアイドル……。","zh":"原来如此。我们是偶像……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f5ef81e089c840f75c96506d300fff172c0208a3f2da508636d8496bedf4ee9b","ja":"ならば、アイドルとして皆を盛り上げ、\n確実に悪霊を退けましょう！","zh":"既然如此，就以偶像的身份让大家情绪高涨起来，\n切实地退治恶灵吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8b33181ff6597a902eaf3bd310d8f53568a72b7b7943ebb19c57035a05ce0a5c","ja":"は、はい！　わ、私も頑張りますぅ！","zh":"好、好的！我、我也会努力的呜！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7f7837418ea24dd08a471968b9ed9cf637ddf6e11d6f5f241e33462713a61f9c","ja":"（よかったぁ、四条さんが気を取り直してくれて。\nこれなら、きっと……）","zh":"（太好了，四条小姐能重新振作起来。\n这样的话，一定……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"63c84429180c7804538bc231c897e62f1ca5f5e58d213ad0903d211473495d40","ja":"ギィィィィィーーーーッ！","zh":"吱——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4ca53e5f779841e695393a8e2ae5350486ad27eeb1e2a4d5f6dbed29d1b58260","ja":"ひっ！？　ま、まさか、悪霊……！","zh":"噫！？难、难道是恶灵……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"47699f868f4a0441e2b386b1183c6852881db6e18b69e09ef18b56bdcecd0e91","ja":"きゃ～～っ！？　お、追い払おうとして\nごめんなさい～～～～！！","zh":"呀～～！？对、对不起，我不该想把您\n赶走的～～～～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a25168a4db5915a95c65b5913103fba73ae4e2896551bb411b7ec88fba0a19e1","ja":"「四条さん、萩原さん、リハーサルの準備が……\nってあれ？　おふたりとも、どうしたんですか！？」","zh":"“四条小姐、萩原小姐，彩排的准备已经……\n咦，奇怪？两位这是怎么了！？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1495.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9f37b205d580c058fcb25135eefa3184ccd7f0de2b9e133981162b74024cc164","ja":"その後、スタッフが開けた扉の音にパニックになった\nふたりが復活するまで、かなりの時間を要したとか……","zh":"之后，两人被工作人员开门的声音吓得陷入了恐慌，\n据说花了相当长的时间才缓过神来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
